# Applies when the Vercel project's Root Directory is set to landing/.
# The repository-root .vercelignore covers the case where it is not.
#
# No re-inclusion patterns: everything publishable lives under assets/ and
# everything excluded lives outside it. _captures/ holds the raw admin
# screenshots, which show real candidate names and email addresses and must
# never reach a public URL.

